  iOS "location.fill" SF Symbol. White so it needs no tint over the widget's dark scrim (Glance can
  rasterise a vector drawable but can't reach the app's Compose Icons, so the widget carries its own).
  Standard Material "near_me" path on a 24dp viewport.
-->
